# Copy this file to .env.local for local testing.
# On Vercel, add the same variables in Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# Never put private keys in frontend code.

# ─── Gemini Google Search Grounding ───
# Add one or more legitimate Google AI Studio keys (comma separated for rotation).
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=your_first_google_ai_studio_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY_2=your_second_google_ai_studio_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY_3=your_third_google_ai_studio_api_key_here
# Or use comma-separated keys for automatic round-robin rotation:
# GOOGLE_AI_API_KEYS=key_1,key_2,key_3

# Recommended Gemini model for free/low-quota use.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-lite

# ─── Rate Limit Tips ───
# The app auto-rotates through all API keys using round-robin.
# Each key gets 14 requests/minute before rotation to the next.
# Each IP is limited to 5 requests/minute to prevent abuse.
# Add 3+ keys for virtually unlimited use for most traffic levels.

# ─── Site URL for SEO/sitemap ───
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://seedfinder-ai-website.vercel.app
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=your_google_search_console_code

# ─── Optional Google AdSense ───
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT=ca-pub-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_TOP_SLOT=1234567890
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_SIDEBAR_SLOT=1234567891
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_RESULTS_SLOT=1234567892

# ─── Optional Upstash Redis (global seed database) ───
# If not set, the site saves seeds in the visitor's browser only.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-upstash-db.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_upstash_rest_token

# ─── Firebase (Authentication & User Data) ───
# Firebase config is hardcoded in app/lib/firebase.ts since these are public keys.
# The Firebase project should have:
# 1. Authentication > Sign-in method > Email/Password (enabled)
# 2. Authentication > Sign-in method > Google (enabled)
# 3. Realtime Database > Rules set to authenticated users only:
#    {
#      "rules": {
#        "users": {
#          "$uid": {
#            ".read": "$uid === auth.uid",
#            ".write": "$uid === auth.uid"
#          }
#        }
#      }
#    }
